# Atmani et al. 2020: HIPS 1.1 mm yoghurt cup, 140 C, depth 67.5 (printed); diameter 51, bottom fillet 21 and draft 1.8
# DERIVED from the render (Fig. 15). Assumptions: atmani2020_cup_d51.notes.md.
sketch plan(on: xy) {
  rim = circle((0, 0), 25.5)
}
cav = extrude(plan, -67.5, taper: 1.8deg)
floor = fillet(edges(of: cav.end), 21)
part = thermoform(cav, t: 1.1, material: "HIPS", tool: "female", flange: 10, shrink: ratio(0), vent: false, temperature: 140, pressure: ratio(0.5))
